# quest/014/BanIxa102_01495 — « Misdirected Woo» · in play order
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>特殊ルール： レベルアジャスト</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>※本クエストは、クラフタークラス：レベル1以上、<br>　バトルクラス：レベル41以上推奨です。 <br><br>エカトル実験場の職工のヤゼル・アファタンは、冒険者に切実な依頼があるようだ。
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Schwierigkeitsanpassung</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>※ Dieser Auftrag wird für Charaktere ab Stufe 41 als Krieger oder Magier und ab Stufe 1 als Handwerker empfohlen.<br><br>In Ehcatl hat Yazel Ahuatan einen dringenden Auftrag für dich.
#. fr: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Règle spéciale<nbsp>:  synchronisation de quête</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>* <i>Avant de commencer cette quête, il est recommandé d'être au niveau 1 minimum pour les disciples de la main, et au niveau 41 minimum pour les disciples de la guerre et de la magie.</i><br><br>Yazel Ahuatan semble avoir un service à vous demander.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <ui-color 508> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 508 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 509> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 509 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Quest Sync</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Able though he may be, there are some situations which Yazel Ahuatan the Able cannot resolve by himself.<br>※The crafting portion of this quest is recommended for Disciples of the Hand level 1 and above, and the battle portion for Disciples of War or Magic level 41 and above."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ※本クエストには「<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509></ui-edge-color></ui-color> レベルアジャスト」が、<br>　設定されています。<br><br>職工のヤゼル・アファタンから「<sheet Item "　8092" 0>」の製作を依頼された。ハーストミルの「アメッタ」に製作施設の使用許可をもらおう。
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509></ui-edge-color></ui-color> Die Schwierigkeit des Auftrags wird an die aktuelle Stufe angepasst.<br><br>Yazel Ahuatan hat dich mit der Herstellung <noun-de Item 1 "　8092" 1 2 1> beauftragt. Bitte Dametta in Mühlenhain um Erlaubnis, ihre Arbeitsstätte nutzen zu dürfen.
#. fr: * <i>Cette quête est <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> synchronisée</ui-edge-color></ui-color> avec votre niveau.</i><br><br>Yazel Ahuatan voudrait que vous fabriquiez <noun-fr Item 1 "　8092" 1 1>. Allez trouver Dametta au Moulin des Bois pour obtenir de sa part l'au<shy>to<shy>ri<shy>sa<shy>tion d'utiliser l'installation d'artisanat du hameau.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_SEQ_01:1"
msgid "Yazel Ahuatan has asked you to craft a bladder lining component so that he might mollify Methuli Cattlan. He has provided the materials, but the facilities are another matter; only those in Hyrstmill, under the care of Dametta, will do. Journey to the hamlet and request her permission.<br><br>※Please note that the difficulty of this quest has been synced to your current level."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 製作施設を使う条件として、アメッタから弁当の配達を頼まれた。エ・タッタ監視哨の「ポールモン」に「<sheet EventItem 2001377 0>」を渡そう。
#. de: Für die Benutzung ihrer Arbeitsstätte hat dich Dametta um einen Gefallen gebeten. Bringe <noun-de EventItem 5 2001377 1 4 1> zu Paulemont an E-Tatts Wachturm!
#. fr: Avant de vous laisser accéder à l'installation d'artisanat, Dametta voudrait que vous vous chargiez d'une livraison. Rendez-vous à la tour d'E-Tatt et apportez <noun-fr EventItem 2 2001377 1 1> à Paulemont.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_SEQ_02:1"
msgid "Dametta is willing to grant you permission to use her facilities─provided you carry out a simple task in exchange. She has prepared a hearty meal for Paulemont, a Wood Wailer stationed at E<hyphen>Tatt's Spire. You need only deliver the meal and return with the sack which held her previous delivery. Alternatively, you could converse with the woman further and attempt to persuade her...but that approach may not end well."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ポールモンに無事、弁当を届けた。ハーストミルの「アメッタ」に証拠の品「<sheet EventItem 2001378 0>」と「<sheet EventItem 2001376 0>」を渡し、製作施設の使用許可をもらおう。
#. de: Paulemont hat sich sehr über das Proviantpaket gefreut und dir dafür das leere Paket der letzten Lieferung mitgegeben. Bringe <noun-de EventItem 2 2001378 1 4 1> zu Dametta zurück und gib ihr auch <noun-de EventItem 2 2001376 1 4 1>.
#. fr: Vous avez remis son panier-repas à Paulemont. Retournez maintenant auprès de Dametta pour lui remettre <noun-fr EventItem 2 2001376 1 1> ainsi que <noun-fr EventItem 2 2001378 1 1> que vous avez reçu<if "<sheet EventItem 2001378 6>">e</if> du vigile sombre.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_SEQ_03:1"
msgid "Paulemont is relieved to receive the meal from someone other than Dametta for a change. He presses an empty sack into your hands and insists that you not forget to return it to his benefactor."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 製作施設の準備が整った。「<sheet Item "　8053" 0>」をもとに「<sheet Item "　8092" 0>」を製作し、エカトル実験場の「職工のヤゼル・アファタン」に納品しよう。<br><br>※バフステータス「製作施設：部材工作」が終了した場合や、「<sheet Item "　8053" 0>」を失った場合は、再びアメッタに話しかけましょう。バフステータスと材料が付与され、再挑戦が可能になります。
#. de: Dametta hat dir erlaubt, ihre Arbeitsstätte zu benutzen. Verarbeite <noun-de Item 2 "　8053" 1 4 1> zu <noun-de Item 1 "　8092" 1 3 1> und bringe es zu Yazel Ahuatan in Ehcatl.<br><br>※ Sollte der Status <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Arbeitsstätte: Herstellung</ui-edge-color></ui-color> enden oder <noun-de Item 2 "　8053" 1 1 1> verloren gehen, kannst du Dametta erneut um Hilfe bitten. Sie wird dir dann das Material und die Arbeitsstätte für einen neuen Versuch zur Verfügung stellen.
#. fr: L'installation d'artisanat est désormais à votre disposition. Servez-vous des matériaux pour créer <noun-fr Item 1 "　8092" 1 1> et le livrer à Yazel Ahuatan, au centre d'essais d'Ehcatl.<br>* <i>Adressez-vous de nouveau à Dametta si vous n'avez plus de matériaux ou si vous avez perdu l'effet Installation<nbsp>: production.</i>
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_SEQ_04:1"
msgid "The sack serves both to inflame Dametta's passions and satisfy her requirements. With the materials provided to you by Yazel Ahuatan, synthesize a bladder lining component, and deliver it to him at Ehcatl.<br><br>※In the event that the status <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Facility Access: Production</ui-edge-color></ui-color> wears off or the synthesis ends in failure, you may try again by speaking with Dametta."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 職工のヤゼル・アファタンに<sheet Item "　8092" 0>を納品した。メトゥリの姐御に臀部の羽毛をむしられずに済んだ彼は、冒険者に心から謝意を表した。熟練の職工の心胆を寒からしめる姐御のお仕置きとは、どれほど苛烈なのだろうか……。
#. de: Du hast <noun-de Item 2 "　8092" 1 4 1> bei Yazel Ahuatan abgeliefert. Gerade noch rechtzeitig, bevor Methuli Cattlan die Geduld verloren und dem armen Yazel die Schwanzfedern gestutzt hätte. Wenn es um ihren Traum vom Fliegen geht, verstehen die Wolkengleiter von Ehcatl wirklich keinen Spaß.
#. fr: Yazel Ahuatan était ravi lorsque vous lui avez remis <noun-fr Item 2 "　8092" 1 1> car, grâce à vous, il a évité de se faire secouer les plumes par Methuli Cattlan. Cette dernière semble crainte de tous au hameau ixal...
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_SEQ_05:1"
msgid "Yazel Ahuatan accepts your work with a mighty squa-hawk, certain that it will meet with Methuli's satisfaction. The most modest of Ixal's posterior shall remain pristine...until next he incurs the wrath of the Hard."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ハーストミルのアメッタと話す
#. de: Mit Dametta in Mühlenhain sprechen
#. fr: Parler à Dametta
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_TODO_00:1"
msgid "Speak with Dametta."
msgstr ""

#. ja: エ・タッタ監視哨のポールモンに<sheet EventItem 2001377 0>を渡す
#. de: Paulemont an E-Tatts Wachturm <noun-de EventItem 5 2001377 1 4 1> bringen 
#. fr: Apporter <noun-fr EventItem 2 2001377 1 1> à Paulemont
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_TODO_01:1"
msgid "Deliver the handmade meal to Paulemont."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ハーストミルのアメッタに<sheet EventItem 2001378 0>と<sheet EventItem 2001376 0>を渡す
#. de: Dametta in Mühlenhain <noun-de EventItem 2 2001378 1 4 1> und <noun-de EventItem 2 2001376 1 4 1> geben
#. fr: Apporter <noun-fr EventItem 2 2001378 1 1> et <noun-fr EventItem 2 2001376 1 1> à Dametta
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_TODO_02:1"
msgid "Present the empty meal sack and the bladder lining component materials to Dametta."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <if ($n1 < $n2)>製作手帳 友好部族クエストLv1：<sheet Item "　8092" 0>を製作<else>職工のヤゼル・アファタンに<sheet Item "　8092" 0>を納品</if>
#. de: <if ($n1 < $n2)>Handwerker-Notizbuch (Freundesvölker) St.1: <noun-de Item 1 "　8092" 1 4 1> herstellen<else>Yazel Ahuatan <noun-de Item 2 "　8092" 1 4 1> bringen</if>
#. fr: <if ($n1 < $n2)>Fabriquer <noun-fr Item 1 "　8092" 1 1><else>Apporter <noun-fr Item 2 "　8092" 1 1> à Yazel Ahuatan</if>
#. kind: objective
#. macro: <if ($n1 < $n2)>Synthesize a bladder lining component<else>Deliver the bladder lining component to Yazel Ahuatan the Able</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 < number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_TODO_03:1"
msgid "<if ($n1 < $n2)>Synthesize a bladder lining component<else>Deliver the bladder lining component to Yazel Ahuatan the Able</if>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <if $gn4>ネエチャン<else>アンチャン</if>、手を貸してくれッェー！<br>「<sheet Item "　8092" 0>」をそろえんと、<br>メトゥリの姐御にケツの羽根までむしられるんじゃッァ！
#. de: Khaaa, khaaa! Stutzt Methuli Cattlan mir Schwanzfedern, wenn ich nicht besorg <noun-de Item 5 "　8092" 1 4 1>. Hilfst du mir, <if $gn4>Federlose<else>Federloser</if>?
#. fr: <if $gn4>Celle-là<else>Celui-là</if> ne pourrait pas aider celui-ci<nbsp>? S'il ne met pas la main sur <noun-fr Item 1 "　8092" 1 1> fissa, il va se faire voler dans les plumes par Methuli Cattlan<nbsp>!
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
#. macro: <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_YAZELAHUATAN_000_000:1"
msgid "Squa-hawk! The one who too would be able, come, <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> is! Then to Yazel, lend a hand, that we might both escape the claws of the Hard!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 気嚢の形を保持するための骨組みリング……<br>あれを作るための軽金属板が足りんのじゃッァ！<br>材料だけは、どうにかそろえたんだがッァ……！
#. de: Pass auf! Um Ballonhülle zu stärken, wir müssen Metallring in Mitte setzen. Ich geb dir Material, khaa, und du machst Ring, klar?
#. fr: Ceux-ci ont besoin d'une plaque d'acier léger pour les arceaux qui donneront sa forme au ballon et peuvent fournir à <if $gn4>celle-là<else>celui-là</if> les matériaux nécessaires à sa fabrication.
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_YAZELAHUATAN_000_010:1"
msgid "Pluck my posterior bare, she shall, if rings of metal for the bladder lining we do not provide!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 気嚢の表面に塗るための塗料……<br>特に耐水性を高める塗料が必要なんじゃッァ！<br>材料だけは、どうにかそろえたんだがッァ……！
#. de: Pass auf! Brauchen wir Mittel zum Einwachsen der Ballonhülle, um sie gegen Wasser und Wind abzudichten. Geb ich dir Material, khaa, und du fertigst Wachs, klar?
#. fr: Ceux-ci ont besoin d'enduit pour imperméabiliser le ballon et peuvent fournir à <if $gn4>celle-là<else>celui-là</if> les matériaux nécessaires à sa préparation.
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_YAZELAHUATAN_000_020:1"
msgid "Pluck my posterior bare, she shall, if water-resistant paint for the bladder lining we do not provide!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 気嚢の強度を高めるための部材……<br>裏張りする生地や木材が足りんのじゃッァ！<br>材料だけは、どうにかそろえたんだがッァ……！
#. de: Pass auf! Um Ballonhülle zu stärken, wir brauchen Stoff- und Lederteil. Geb ich dir Material, khaa, und du machst Bauteil, klar?
#. fr: Ceux-ci ont besoin d'un contreplaqué recouvert de cuir pour améliorer la résistance du ballon et peuvent fournir à <if $gn4>celle-là<else>celui-là</if> les matériaux nécessaires à sa fabrication.
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_YAZELAHUATAN_000_030:1"
msgid "Pluck my posterior bare, she shall, if leather-backed plywood for the bladder lining we do not provide!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: アンタならハーストミルって集落にも入れるだろッォ？<br>あそこに「<sheet Item "　8092" 0>」を作れる丈夫な作業台があるッゥ！<br>「アメッタ」って女に設備を借りて、製作してきてくれッェ！
#. de: Gehst du nach Mühlenhain und fragst federlose Dametta nach ihrer Arbeitsstätte. Die ist genau richtig für Herstellung von <noun-de Item 5 "　8092" 1 3 1>. Schnell, schnell, meine Schwanzfedern sind in Gefahr!
#. fr: <if $gn4>Celle-là<else>Celui-là</if> pourra trouver au Moulin des Bois les ins<shy>tal<shy>la<shy>tions qui lui permettront de travailler dans de bonnes conditions. Mais il lui faudra d'abord le con<shy>sen<shy>te<shy>ment de Dametta<nbsp>!
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
#. macro: <if $gn4>craftswoman<else>craftsman</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_YAZELAHUATAN_000_040:1"
msgid "Able to craft this component himself, Yazel is, were it not for Ehcatl's dearth of facilities. Squa-hawk! Those of Hyrstmill, suffice they shall, but welcome within their walls, Yazel is not. With featherless chatterbox, featherless <if $gn4>craftswoman<else>craftsman</if> should speak."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ハーストミルで「<sheet Item "　8092" 0>」を製作してきてくれッェ！<br>「アメッタ」って女に設備が借りられるッゥ。<br>このままじゃ、姐御にケツの羽根までむしられちまうッゥ！
#. de: Khaa, gehst du nach Mühlenhain und machst <noun-de Item 5 "　8092" 1 3 1> bei Damettas Arbeitsstätte. Khaa, khaa, schnell, meine Schwanzfedern sind in Gefahr!
#. fr: Que <if $gn4>celle-là<else>celui-là</if> aille dare-dare au Moulin des Bois et demande à Dametta la permission de fabriquer <noun-fr Item 1 "　8092" 1 1>, sinon celui-ci risque d'y laisser des plumes<nbsp>!
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_YAZELAHUATAN_000_050:1"
msgid "Highly unattractive, Yazel's posterior would be, if plucked bare of feathers. For the sake of Ixali maidens, with my materials and the featherless chatterbox's facilities, craft the component we require! Squa-hawk!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: あー、あんた職人さんだね？<br>はいはい、心得てるよ。<br>ここの作業台を使って、仕事したいってんだろ？
#. de: Ja, aber natürlich kannst du meine Arbeitsstätte benutzen.
#. fr: Laissez-moi deviner. Vous êtes ici pour utiliser nos ins<shy>tal<shy>la<shy>tions d'artisanat, n'est-ce pas<nbsp>? Il faut dire aussi qu'il n'y a pas grand-chose d'autre à faire dans le coin...
#. speaker: DAMETTA
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_DAMETTA_000_060:1"
msgid "I know that look─you've a mind to use these facilities, don't you? It's hardly the first time, suffice it to say. I find it quite flattering, actually─and who wouldn't? That the facilities I've worked so hard to maintain are in such high demand is high praise indeed!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: こっちはかまわないけど、ひとつお願いがあるんだよね。<br>鬼哭隊の隊士さんに、差し入れを届けておくれよ。<br>最近、魔物が多くてねぇ、女ひとりで出歩くのは危険なのさ。
#. de: Darf ich dich vorher um einen kleinen Gefallen bitten? Ich müsste dringend ein Proviantpaket ausliefern, aber neuerdings kann sich eine alte Frau ja nicht mehr alleine in den Wald trauen.
#. fr: Je vous y autoriserai avec plaisir, dès que vous aurez fait quelque chose pour moi en échange. En fait, j'ai ici un panier-repas pour un vigile sombre, mais les bois sont trop dangereux pour que je lui apporte moi-même... Pourriez-vous vous en occuper à ma place<nbsp>?
#. speaker: DAMETTA
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_DAMETTA_000_061:1"
msgid "However! That same demand means that I cannot allow unrestricted access, I'm sorry to say. Oh, don't look at me like that! Can you imagine the state they would be in if I let every traveler have the run of the place? It'd be no better than a pigsty!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 届け先はエ・タッタ監視哨の「ポールモン」って人だよ。<br>ちゃんと届けた証拠に、<br>「<sheet EventItem 2001378 0>」を受け取ってきてよ！
#. de: Sei so gut und bring das Proviantpaket für mich zu Paulemont an E-Tatts Wachturm. Er wird dir bestimmt <noun-de EventItem 2 2001378 1 4 1> von der letzten Lieferung mitgeben. Bring es mir bitte zurück, ja?
#. fr: L'homme en question s'appelle Paulemont et vous le trouverez à la tour d'E-Tatt. N'oubliez pas de recevoir <noun-fr EventItem 1 2001378 1 1> de sa part pour que je lui prépare sa ration pour demain<nbsp>!
#. speaker: DAMETTA
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_DAMETTA_000_062:1"
msgid "But worry not! You may use them if you take this lunch to Paulemont at E<hyphen>Tatt's Spire. A simple delivery should be no trouble for a strapping adventurer like yourself! Oh, and do remember to bring me any empty containers he may have. I reuse them, you see. One must <i>never</i> be wasteful!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: おや、あんたヒマなのかい？<br>じゃあちょっと、話を聞いていくかい？<br>頼んだ差し入れは、別に急ぎの仕事じゃないからさ。
#. de: Ach, du möchtest noch ein Schwätzchen halten? Aber gerne doch! Die Proviantlieferung eilt ja nicht.
#. fr: Mais ne vous précipitez pas. J'ai une histoire à vous raconter, et je suis sûre qu'elle va vous passionner.
#. speaker: DAMETTA
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_DAMETTA_000_070:1"
msgid "Paulemont never leaves his post, so I've no doubt you'll find him at E<hyphen>Tatt's Spire. Nevertheless, I pray you don't take too long to deliver it! Meals are always best served fresh!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ポールモンさんは、ここら一帯の警備をしてる隊士さんでね。<br>いつもご苦労さんって、ムントゥイ豆乳をおすそわけしたら、<br>すっかり気に入ってくれたんだよ。
#. de: Paulemont ist ja so ein fleißiger Soldat. Unermüdlich hält er vor dem Turm Wache, als müsste er niemals schlafen. Zur Stärkung mache ich ihm immer leckeres Essen und frische Mun-Tuy-Milch.
#. fr: En fait, Paulemont est un vigile sombre qui patrouille ré<shy>gu<shy>liè<shy>re<shy>ment entre le Moulin des Bois et la tour d'E-Tatt. Pour le remercier de faire son travail con<shy>scien<shy>cieu<shy>sement, je lui ai offert une bouteille de mon fameux lait de Mun-Tuy, un geste qu'il a beaucoup apprécié.
#. speaker: DAMETTA
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_DAMETTA_000_071:1"
msgid "Such a dedicated Wailer, Paulemont is─and kind, too! I used to send him Mun<hyphen>Tuy tonic, and do you know what he did? He shared it with his comrades when supplies ran low!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: それから、豆乳だけじゃなく、弁当も差し入れしてるのさ。<br>ウチの旦那より、よっぽど男前だし……そのうえ…………<br>…………真面目なもんで………ただねぇ…………
#. de: Beides schmeckt ihm immer so gut und gibt ihm Kraft! Ach, was für ein Prachtkerl. Viel stattlicher als mein Mann, der alte Tunichtgut!
#. fr: Depuis, je lui en fais ré<shy>gu<shy>liè<shy>re<shy>ment cadeau, et je lui prépare aussi des paniers-repas pour qu'il ne fasse pas sa ronde le ventre vide. Il faut dire aussi qu'il a beaucoup plus de charme que mon mari et... (blablabla)... beaucoup d'humour... (blablabla)...
#. speaker: DAMETTA
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_DAMETTA_000_072:1"
msgid "Just between you and me, he's quite handsome too! Much more than my husband, that's for sure. Oh, but don't go getting any ideas─I'd never do anything <i>indecent</i>. But a woman has eyes, you know!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……本当にオポオポは………………しつこくて……<br>…………参っちまうよね……だいたいあいつら……<br>……そう、少しは…………加減ってものを…………
#. de: Ach ja, und die Opo-Opos mal wieder ... ganz schön frech, die Biester ... kann man sich ja nicht bieten lassen ... und überhaupt ... \<blablabla>
#. fr: Heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment d'ailleurs, car avec tous ces opo-opo qui... (blablabla)... ne sait plus où donner de la tête et... (blablabla)... méritent une bonne leçon... (blablabla)...
#. speaker: DAMETTA
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_DAMETTA_000_073:1"
msgid "Like the other day, when a horde of ravenous opo<hyphen>opos burst through the gates and began raiding our storehouses, a party of courageous adventurers came to our defense. So strong and skilled they were─and <i>fetching</i> too! One young man in particular had such <i>lovely</i> arms, and for a moment I couldn't help but imagine them wrapped around me..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: アメッタの話は続いている……。
#. de: Dametta redet ... und redet ... und redet ...
#. fr: Dametta continue à raconter son histoire...
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_SYSTEM_100_073:1"
msgid "As Dametta continues to wax poetic about various men, your mind begins to wander..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: アメッタさん特製の弁当を待ってるんだが、<br>なかなか届かないな……。<br>話好きな人だから、誰かと話し込んで遅くなってるのかな？
#. de: Entschuldige mein lautes Magenknurren. Ich warte auf Proviant von Dametta. Diesmal lässt sie ganz schön auf sich warten. Sie ist ja eine herzensgute Frau, aber leider auch sehr geschwätzig. Vermutlich kann sie sich mal wieder nicht losreißen.
#. fr: C'est étrange, Dametta me fait parvenir mon panier-repas beaucoup plus tôt, d'habitude. La connaissant, elle a encore dû trouver quelqu'un avec qui bavarder et elle a oublié de préparer mon casse-croûte...
#. speaker: PAULEMONT
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_PAULEMONT_000_080:1"
msgid "Gods save me, today's the day, isn't it? She'll be here any moment..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: おおっ、待っていたよ！<br>……前回の差し入れの容器も回収してくれるのかい？<br>じゃあ、この弁当箱をアメッタさんに返却してくれよ！
#. de: Ach, das ist ja klasse! Endlich etwas zu essen! Kannst du das leere Proviantpaket vom letzten Mal gleich mitnehmen und zu Dametta bringen?
#. fr: Oh, vous êtes venu<if $gn4>e</if> ici exprès pour me l'apporter<nbsp>? Comme c'est aimable à vous<nbsp>! Tenez, voici la boîte du panier-repas qu'elle a préparé pour moi hier. J'apprécierais si vous pouviez la rendre à Dametta lorsque vous la reverrez.
#. speaker: PAULEMONT
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_PAULEMONT_000_081:1"
msgid "Is that from Dametta? I, uh... Thank you! Here, don't forget this! No need for her to come all this way to fetch an empty sack, am I right?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 弁当箱をアメッタさんに返却してくれよ！<br>よろしくな！
#. de: Danke für das Essen! Bring bitte das leere Proviantpaket zu Dametta, ja?
#. fr: Pourriez-vous rendre à Dametta la boîte du panier-repas qu'elle a préparé pour moi hier<nbsp>? Merci d'avance<nbsp>!
#. speaker: PAULEMONT
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_PAULEMONT_000_090:1"
msgid "All things considered, it could be far worse. At least she's not forcing that gods-awful tonic on me anymore."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet EventItem 2001378 0>」を回収してきたのかい？<br>だったら約束どおり、ここを使わせてあげなきゃね。<br>下準備をするから、持ち込んだ材料と一緒に貸してごらん。
#. de: Und, hat es dem guten Jungen geschmeckt? Hoffentlich hat er dir <noun-de EventItem 2 2001378 1 4 1> mitgegeben. Gib es mir bitte, ja? Ach ja, zeig mir bitte auch das Material, das du verarbeiten möchtest! Dann bereite ich die Arbeitsstätte vor.
#. fr: Ah, vous revoilà<nbsp>! Avez-vous trouvé Paulemont<nbsp>? Quelle bonne nouvelle<nbsp>! Comme promis, je vous laisse utiliser nos ins<shy>tal<shy>la<shy>tions d'artisanat. Pourriez-vous me remettre <noun-fr Item 2 2001378 1 1> ainsi que les matériaux que vous souhaitez utiliser<nbsp>?
#. speaker: DAMETTA
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_DAMETTA_000_100:1"
msgid "I do so hope Paulemont wasn't disappointed that I couldn't deliver his meal in person. I trust you've brought the empty sack? Oh, and as a precaution, I must ask that you present your materials for inspection as well. You would be <i>shocked</i> by what some people have tried to make here, believe me!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: おやまあ、ずいぶん多めに持ち込んだんだね？<br>かさばる袋は預かって、材料は製作に必要な分だけ返すよ。<br>あとはこの場所を、好きに使って製作するんだね！
#. de: Ja, das Material taugt etwas, keine Frage. Bitte, fang ruhig an! Die Arbeitsstätte ist bereit!
#. fr: Voilà, tout est prêt pour que vous puissiez travailler en toute liberté.
#. speaker: DAMETTA
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_DAMETTA_000_101:1"
msgid "My word, would you look how spotless it is! Nothing more satisfying than seeing that your man─ahem, that your <i>friend</i> didn't leave a single crumb. Ahem. Ah, yes, your materials! Though unusual, I don't believe they could be used for evil ends. Here you are. You'll note I didn't return them all─there are several times the required materials, it would seem. Whoever entrusted this task to you left a note in the bag: “To featherless neuker, give only required parts. In case of failure, retain spares.” Hmmm... What in the world is a “neuker”?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 材料が足りなくなったり、<br>またこの場所を使いたくなったら、声をかけてちょうだい。
#. de: Falls das Material nicht reicht oder du mit der Arbeitsstätte nicht zurechtkommst, dann frag mich einfach. Ich bin sicher, wir kriegen das hin.
#. fr: Si vous veniez à manquer de matériaux ou si vous décidiez de remettre votre travail à plus tard, il vous suffira de me faire signe.
#. speaker: DAMETTA
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_DAMETTA_000_110:1"
msgid "Oh, do you require more time with the facilities? By all means, take as long as you like! And if you require additional materials, let me know. I have plenty here for the “featherless neuker.”"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 仕事は終わったみたいだから、早く納品に行きなよ！<br>製作した品をなくしたりして、また作りなおすときは、<br>声をかけておくれ。
#. de: Na, bist du fertig mit der Arbeit? Dann lass deinen Auftraggeber nicht länger warten! Falls du den Gegenstand verlieren solltest und neu anfertigen musst, kannst du dich gerne wieder bei mir melden.
#. fr: Ça y est, vous en avez terminé<nbsp>? Dans ce cas, hâtez-vous d'apporter sa commande à votre client. Si vous perdez quelque chose en chemin, venez me le faire savoir, d'accord<nbsp>?
#. speaker: DAMETTA
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_DAMETTA_100_100:1"
msgid "Is that the finished product? I...I have no idea what that is, but it looks splendid! I'm sure your client will love it! Ah─it so happens there was another note in the bag: “Retain spare parts, in case featherless neuker loses component en route.” He really doesn't trust you, does he?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: おっ、<if $gn4>ネエチャン<else>アンチャン</if>！<br>「<sheet Item "　8092" 0>」は完成したかッァ……？
#. de: Khaa, khaa, hast du <noun-de Item 2 "　8092" 1 4 1>? Zeig her!
#. fr: Enfin<nbsp>! Celui-ci attendait <if $gn4>celle-là<else>celui-là</if> avec impatience. Apporte-t-<if $gn4>elle<else>il</if> ce que celui-ci lui a demandé<nbsp>?
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
#. macro: <if $gn4>craftswoman<else>craftsman</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_YAZELAHUATAN_000_130:1"
msgid "Feathered, my precious posterior yet is, but not for long if featherless <if $gn4>craftswoman<else>craftsman</if> does not deliver bladder lining component!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: これでメトゥリの姐御にッィ、<br>ケツの羽根までむしられずに済むッゥ！<br>助かったわッァ！
#. de: Danke! Meine Schwanzfedern sind gerettet. Methuli wird sie mir nicht mehr stutzen vor Ungeduld!
#. fr: Magnifique<nbsp>! <if $gn4>Celle-là<else>Celui-là</if> ne s'en rend peut-être pas compte, mais <if $gn4>elle<else>il</if> vient de sauver la vie de celui-ci<nbsp>! Methuli n'est pas du genre à rigoler, si <if $gn4>celle-là<else>celui-là</if> voit ce que celui-ci veut dire...
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_YAZELAHUATAN_000_131:1"
msgid "Squa-hawk! A gift to the Ehcatl, your craftsmanship is, and a gift to Ixali maidens, Yazel remains! Ah─ Squahaha! Naught more than jest, my words are, of course. Never would Methuli harm his tailfeathers, Yazel knows."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 姐御は冗談なんて言わねえからなッァ！！<br>やると言ったら、<ruby>本気<rt>マジ</ruby>でやる女なんじゃッァ！<br><if $gn4>ネエチャン<else>アンチャン</if>は、ワシのケツの羽根の恩人じゃあッァ！
#. de: Mit Methuli ist nicht zu spaßen, wirklich nicht! Vor allem, wenn's um unseren Traum geht!
#. fr: Elle est la terreur du centre d'essais, et aucun de ceux-ci n'ose lui tenir tête<nbsp>! Grâce à <if $gn4>celle-là<else>celui-là</if>, celui-ci ne se fera pas arracher une à une les plumes du postérieur<nbsp>! Merci, <if $gn4>bienfaitrice<else>bienfaiteur</if><nbsp>!
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_YAZELAHUATAN_000_132:1"
msgid "(A buzzard to be feared, the Hard is. Ware her claws, lest you suffer her wrath as I have!)"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 製作の準備が整った。
#. de: Die Arbeitsstätte steht dir jetzt zur Verfügung.
#. fr: Vous pouvez maintenant utiliser les installations d'artisanat.
#. speaker: POPMESSAGE
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa102_01495:TEXT_BANIXA102_01495_POPMESSAGE_000_200:1"
msgid "You now have access to the crafting facility."
msgstr ""
